{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44768","headline":"湘夫人祠 · 大易","name":"湘夫人祠","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"灵祠古木合，波扬大江濆。\n未□湘南雨，知爲何处云。\n苔痕涩珠履，草色妒罗裙。\n妙鼓彤云瑟，羁臣不可闻。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"大易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_44768.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44768","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}